        "body": "I finished my review and found nothing to comment on. Nice work! :tada:\n\n- The cache key uses valid `key:files` with `prefix`, and `$CI_JOB_NAME_SLUG` gives each job its own key.\n- Go and golangci-lint versions agree in `.tool-versions` and `.gitlab-ci.yml`, and `check-go-version.sh` enforces the Go pairing.\n- No job that extends `.go-cache` overrides `cache:`, so all of them pick up the new key safely."
